gum format -- '# Welcome to your OneDep Devbox. Here are some useful commands:' '## OneDep CLI commands:' '' '- `odm instance info`: Get information about the current OneDep instance.' '- `odm packages get all|PACKAGE`: Get all available packages or information about a specific package. Partial matches work e.g. `odm packages get all` or `odm packages get admin`.' '- `odm config edit`: Edit the OneDep configuration file.' '- `odm config get VAR_NAME`: Get the value of variable from site-config.' '' '## Aliases' '' "Some useful aliases can be found in \`~/.onedep_funcs_${WWPDB_SITE_ID}\` to navigate across OneDep directories." | gum style --border-foreground 152 --border rounded --width 100 --padding "2 4"